# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. Reproduces production before
# #4599 (#4587): the only fall-off probe read the receiver's own WAL, so a source trim
# requested no re-bootstrap and the entries it skipped never reached r.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceFallOffUndetected
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a trim past the receiver is not detected, so no re-bootstrap repairs the entries it skipped
PERTURBS: Trim

--- FIND
    /\ \E t \in (cursor[<<s, r>>] + 1)..Len(wal[s]) : cursor' = [cursor EXCEPT ![<<s, r>>] = t]
    /\ fellOff' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ \E t \in (cursor[<<s, r>>] + 1)..Len(wal[s]) : cursor' = [cursor EXCEPT ![<<s, r>>] = t]
\* MUTATION: fall-off is not detected.
    /\ fellOff' = fellOff
--- END
